LANG.en.guideBody="🔮 Tarot — Choose a spread and draw. Tap each card to reveal its short reading; tap again for its expanded meaning, symbolism, question and suggested step. Browse all 78 cards in the card library without drawing.\n\n🌙 Dreams — Write in English for the English local library, or switch to Hebrew to write in Hebrew. The local engine recognizes known words and situations; it does not understand every possible story. Optional emotions, endings, follow-up answers and personal associations help guide the reading. You can remove an incorrect identification. AI is an optional deeper reading and sends your text to your chosen provider only when requested.\n\n📓 Journal — Up to 50 dreams are saved on this device. Open and edit an entry, add tags or favorites, and save personal associations for optional use in future dreams. Notes are your own words and are not automatically translated.\n\n🌐 Languages — Hebrew and English include content. Russian, Spanish and Arabic have a translated interface with English readings and English local dream matching. Change language in Settings.\n\n📥 Offline — Open the app from its hosted address while online and save the full deck from the Tarot screen. The interface, local readings and saved deck then work offline. AI requires a connection.\n\n💾 Backup — Export a backup from Settings to keep a separate copy of your saved entries.\n\n🥠 Fortune cookie — One message each day, for inspiration and entertainment.";
for(const lang of ["ru","es","ar"])LANG[lang].guideBody=LANG.en.guideBody;
if(contentLang()==="en")AI_PROVIDERS.local.name="On-device AI (Ollama)";

